        "type": "p",
        "text": "You do not have to pick one and stick with it, and most people use all of these together. Start a **Private Chat** for the personal, open a **Group** to collaborate, build a **Community** as you grow, and lean on **Channels** and **Broadcasts** to keep everyone informed. When each conversation lives in the space built for it, staying connected feels effortless at any scale."
